  "texts": {
    "preamble": "State Represented By vs Nijam Sahul Hameed on 4 July, 2019 Author: G.R.Swaminathan Bench: G.R.Swaminathan 1 Before The Madurai Bench Of Madras High Court Dated: 04.07.2019 Coram: The Honourable Mr.Justice G.R.Swaminathan Crl. A.(MD)No.186 of 2010",
    "facts": "The respondents herein were prosecuted for the offence under Section 16(1) (a) (i), (ii) r/w 7(i) 2(ia) (a) and (m) of the Prevention of Food Adulteration Act. Challenging the same, this Criminal Appeal has been filed by the Food Inspector, Pudukottai Municipal Corporation, Pudukottai. It is seen that there was no compliance of the requirement as per the provisions of Section 13(2) of the Prevention of Food Adulteration Act.",
